msgstr "Security Warning"

#: src/widgets/ai_settings_dialog.vala:250
msgid "HTTP 端点安全风险"
msgstr "HTTP Endpoint Security Risk"

#: src/widgets/ai_settings_dialog.vala:251
msgid "使用 HTTP (非 HTTPS) 端点时，API 密钥将在网络中明文传输，存在安全风险。"
msgstr ""
"When using an HTTP (non-HTTPS) endpoint, the API key will be transmitted in "
"plaintext over the network, which poses a security risk."

#: src/widgets/ai_settings_dialog.vala:324
msgid ""
"您正在配置 HTTP (非 HTTPS) 端点。\n"
"\n"
"这将导致 API 密钥在传输过程中以明文形式发送，存在被第三方截获的风险。\n"
"\n"
"是否仍要继续保存？"
msgstr ""
"You are configuring an HTTP (non-HTTPS) endpoint.\n"
"\n"
"This will cause the API key to be sent in plaintext during transmission, with the risk of being intercepted by third parties.\n"
"\n"
"Do you still want to continue saving?"

#: src/widgets/ai_settings_dialog.vala:329
